[D Quests for Stratholme Living, the Scarlet half of Stratholme behind the main gate \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 59-60 Stratholme Living]
[NX 59-60 Stratholme Undead]

Every quest here needs level 55 and is open to both factions. The main gate of Stratholme stands at the far north-west corner of the Eastern Plaguelands; the quest givers wait at Light's Hope Chapel in the east of the zone and at Egan's hut near the city.

-- Left out, owned by the Stratholme Undead guide: 5213 The Active Agent, 5263 Above and Beyond, 5125 Aurius' Reckoning (Aurius offers it once you finished 5122 here), 6163 Ramstein, 5961 The Champion of the Banshee Queen.
-- Left out: 5461 to 5465 (Ras Frostwhisper's Keepsake chain, 5463 Menethil's Gift): only 5463 touches Stratholme; the chain is a round trip from Caer Darrow to Stromgarde and back and ends at 5466 in Scholomance. No guide carries it yet.
-- Left out: 8945 Dead Man's Plea and the rest of the Anthion chain (8946 onward): the dungeon-set upgrade chain starts in Orgrimmar, Ironforge or Blackrock Mountain and only passes through Stratholme for one fight.
-- Left out: 5305 Sweet Serenity and 5307 Corruption (Blacksmith quests from Winterspring; Dungeon Quest Atlas marks them unverified on Forever), 7622 The Balance of Light and Shadow (Priest-only event at the city gates, unverified on Forever), 9257 Atiesh (Naxxramas raid chain), 8968 and 8991 (Bodley and Valthalak dungeon-set chain, which only passes through here).

-- Horde: Undercity, then the road east through the Plaguelands.
[A Horde] Start in Undercity. At Michael Garrett, get the Undercity flight path [P Undercity] [G63.1,48.3 Undercity]
[A Horde] Take the lift up and leave Undercity [G56.8,17.2 Undercity][G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades] [OC]
[A Horde] East along the road through Tirisfal Glades to the Bulwark [G83.1,65.0 Tirisfal Glades][G84.5,70.5 Tirisfal Glades][G97.8,71.3 Tirisfal Glades] [OC] \\ A Fallen Hero (elite, level 58-59) stands near 83,71 by the Bulwark.
[A Horde] On into the Western Plaguelands and north-east to the Thondroril River, then swim across it to Tirion's hut [G52.1,41.8 Western Plaguelands][G62.7,26.8 Western Plaguelands][G5.2,35.6 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Scourge mobs of level 53-60 line the road. The Husk (elite, level 62) roams near 62,36 in the Western Plaguelands, and a Nerubian Overseer (elite, level 60) stands near 6,31 by the river.

-- Alliance: Southshore, Chillwind Camp, then the road north-east.
[A Alliance] Start in Southshore. At Darla Harris, get the Southshore flight path [P Southshore] [G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] North out of Southshore and up the road into the hills to the Western Plaguelands [G58.0,40.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G62.2,18.3 Hillsbrad Foothills][G69.7,7.1 Hillsbrad Foothills][G72.7,1.5 Hillsbrad Foothills][G43.4,92.5 Western Plaguelands][G43.6,86.0 Western Plaguelands] [OC] \\ The road passes Tarren Mill, a Horde town with level 55 elite guards; keep to the road past it.
[A Alliance] At Bibilfaz Featherwhistle in Chillwind Camp, get the Chillwind Camp flight path [P Chillwind Camp] [G42.9,85.0 Western Plaguelands]
[A Alliance] North past Andorhal and north-east to the Thondroril River, then swim across it to Tirion's hut [G50.4,72.5 Western Plaguelands][G56.4,51.6 Western Plaguelands][G59.2,47.4 Western Plaguelands][G64.0,34.8 Western Plaguelands][G5.2,35.6 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Scourge mobs of level 53-60 line the road. A Fallen Hero (elite, level 58-59) stands near 52,55, The Husk (elite, level 62) roams near 62,36, and a Nerubian Overseer (elite, level 60) stands near 6,31 by the river.

